# The PostgreSQL archive each release installer carries, one per target
# `release.yml` builds: `<sha256>  <asset>` of
# https://github.com/theseus-rs/postgresql-binaries/releases/tag/<version>.
# `scripts/fetch-postgres.sh` downloads the one for its target and refuses a
# file that does not match. The version is `knobas-db`'s `PG_VERSION_REQ`
# (`crates/knobas-app/src/postgres.rs` has the test), so the two move together.
