7da44c2dbcda3b49688ea08ce8cf99cfe677adf565f53a9145bf9002c74db7d5  postgresql-18.6.0-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.tar.gz
bb3d09f876b2383e25a8c9ce09e32d185a03656a23d074f5195542b1b1b3ca61  postgresql-18.6.0-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz
